  ["Which statement about sympathetic and parasympathetic pathways is most accurate?", ["One excites every organ and the other inhibits every organ", "They coordinate organ-specific responses and often have opposing effects", "They are both parts of the endocrine system", "They carry only sensory information"], 1, "Autonomic effects depend on the organ, receptors, and situation; the two divisions often coordinate opposing effects.", 398]
